      "message": "I don\u0027t think that check is worth it. We should be very careful about what we add to the staging allowlist, so I don\u0027t anticipate cases where someone will commit untested modules to the staging allowlist (and not realize it in presubmits!) At this point we basically need a tracking bug for each staging item.\n\nSince the dev mode allowlist logic isn\u0027t as straightforward as \"allowlist by name\", I think this validation will add more technical complexity than its worth.",
